{%- comment -%}
  New Gang Sheet Builder CTA
  ---------------------------
  Renders next to the existing Build-a-Gang-Sheet app block on the
  product.build-a-gang-sheet template. Visibility is controlled by the
  Optimizely experiment (see snippets/optimizely-gang-sheet-experiment.liquid).

  Default: hidden. Shown only when html[data-gsb-experiment="variant"] is set.

  The button links to the new Next.js gang sheet builder served via Shopify
  App Proxy at /apps/ninja-gang-sheet. The selected Shopify variant ID is
  passed as a URL param; the new builder resolves size + transfer type from it.
  Opens in the same tab.

  Styling note: we intentionally reuse the .gs--wrapper/.gs--button/.w3_bg
  classes from the Build-a-Gang-Sheet app so both variations of the
  experiment render visually identical buttons. The app owns that CSS.

  Accepts:
    product (required) - the Shopify product object
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign proxy_path = '/apps/ninja-gang-sheet' -%}
{%- assign default_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}

<div
  class="new-gang-sheet-cta-wrapper gs--wrapper w3_bg"
  data-gsb-variant="new"
  data-gsb-proxy-path="{{ proxy_path }}"
>
  <script type="application/json" class="new-gang-sheet-cta-variants">
    {{ product.variants | json }}
  </script>
  <a
    class="gs--button w3_bg"
    data-gsb-new-cta
    href="{{ proxy_path }}{% if default_variant %}?variant={{ default_variant.id }}{% endif %}"
  >
    Build your own Gang Sheet
  </a>
</div>

{{ 'new-gang-sheet-cta.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'new-gang-sheet-cta.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
